  "body": "Consider `<div onclick=\"import('./foo.js')\">`. Per spec this code is evaluated via https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#the-event-handler-processing-algorithm. There is no active script at this time, causing the import() spec to blow up (fail an assert).\r\n\r\nThis is somewhat similar to what was fixed by https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3163. The fix is less obvious though. I guess we'd create a synthetic script representing the page's inline event handlers??\r\n\r\n/cc @whatwg/modules",
